      "settings": {
        "show_navigation": false,
        "title": "FAQ",
        "content": "<p>The Net Return’s portable commercial golf simulator packages are the perfect foundation for a fully customized simulator setup in your business, country club, golf course, or community center. Compatible with third-party golf launch monitors, our portable bays enable you to design a tailored system for indoor golf practice, professional training, or recreational use.</p><p>Whether you’re improving customer experiences, attracting members, or enhancing community programs, The Net Return offers durable, reliable nets that maximize your space, time, and investment. Explore our range of golf simulator solutions today and elevate your offerings to the next level.</p>",
